# Playwright/Allure run artifacts — e2e/playwright/.gitignore already covers these relative to
# that folder, but these unanchored patterns catch them wherever a test run happens to write them
# (e.g. if `playwright test` or `allure generate` is ever run from the repo root instead).
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
allure-results/
allure-report/

# Generado por list-variants.js/.ps1 contra el catálogo real de Printify — se desactualiza apenas
